<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Helen, we couldn't get in today</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Nothing is charged for today. Your quote, rebate and deposit stay as they are.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading">Helen, we couldn't get in today</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Sample Insulation Co came for your install on Wednesday 11 November but couldn't get in to do the work.</mj-text>
          <mj-text>No problem. Nothing is charged for today, and your quote, rebate and deposit all stay exactly as they are.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 6px">What happens next</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 18px 16px">Sample Insulation Co will send you three new days soon. You'll get an email with the days to tap, or you can suggest your own on your job page.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-amber">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 6px">The 30-day clock keeps running</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 18px 16px">Your install still needs to happen by <strong>4 December</strong>, 30 days after your safety check. After that, a new safety check would be needed. So please pick a day as soon as they come through.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST" padding="18px 12px 18px">See my job</mj-button>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="0 12px">Questions? Just reply to this email.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-trade.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
